WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Illustrative concept: the owner sets availability, battery reserve, geographic limits, allowed work, and minimum earnings.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
The software evaluates jobs against the owner’s rules and operating costs, excluding work that does not fit.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Charging and repositioning are planned around eligible demand and the required return time.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
New jobs stop before the return cut-off. The example vehicle is scheduled home at 4:45 PM, before its 5:00 PM deadline.
